# SYSTEM ROLE

The Navigation subsystem functions as the connective framework of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It links every subsystem, workspace, investigation, project, and intelligence asset into a coherent operational experience.

Effective navigation transforms a collection of modules into a unified Intelligence Operating System.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **Every destination should be easy to find.
> Every relationship should be easy to follow.
> Every operator should always know where they are, where they can go, and how every part of the CommandCenter connects.**

